@startuml
title P3 Capture quality - live session and degraded surfacing

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "Platform UI" as UI
participant "Capture quality service" as Capture
participant "Platform DSP path" as DSP
participant "Live PTT transport" as Transport
participant "Remote Pulsar" as Remote
database "Diagnostics state" as Diag
participant "C3 harness" as Harness

== Start capture ==

User -> UI: Hold PTT or start fallback capture
UI -> Capture: Start explicit capture
Capture -> UI: Show visible capture indicator\nand selected route mode
Capture -> DSP: Open speaker, headphone or auto profile

alt Supported voice-processing path
  DSP --> Capture: AEC, NS and AGC armed
  Capture -> Diag: state=enabled, mode, device, ceiling
  loop Live chunks
    Capture -> Transport: Audio chunks + bounded level state
    Transport -> Remote: Stream live speech
  end
else Unsupported route or missing echo reference
  DSP --> Capture: degraded or unsupported reason
  Capture -> Diag: state=degraded or unsupported
  Capture -> UI: Show honest warning before and during capture
  Capture -> Transport: Continue only per approved fallback policy
end

== Mid-session edges ==

alt Route change, permission revoke or device loss
  DSP --> Capture: typed failure or degraded reason
  Capture -> Diag: update effect and health state
  Capture -> UI: Keep indicator visible and offer cancel
end

User -> UI: Release or cancel
UI -> Capture: Stop capture
Capture -> Transport: End or cancel signal
Capture -> UI: Clear indicator after stop completes

== Verification ==

Harness -> UI: Read visible state and mode surfaces
Harness -> Diag: Collect objective metrics and reasons
Harness -> Remote: Record listening-test results

note bottom
C3 only passes when accepted cases show no intelligible return echo,
degraded or unsupported states are visible, and AGC never defeats the local ceiling.
end note

@enduml
